+#
+# Read off the SAME point-in-time `edgar_facts` store the backtest trusts,
+# refreshed on the ingest script's own cadence — not a second EDGAR-calling
+# code path beside `edgar_pit.py`/`ingest_edgar_facts.py`. The consequence
+# is that the split is available to as-of sheets for free, and that no
+# per-convene SEC request is ever made for it.
